Drives record again while the app is closed.

- Fixes a problem that could stop drive tracking from running in the background, so trips taken with Taxottic closed were not recorded. Open the app once after updating and tracking restarts itself.
- Notifications now reach iPhones. An alert about a tracking problem goes to the driver directly instead of only to a manager.
- A phone that quietly stops recording in the background is now spotted on its own, rather than going unnoticed.
